# so `graphify .` maps the source of truth, not build output.

# Build / generated output
dist/
build/
reports/
artifacts/
graphify-out/
**/graphify-out/
graphify-out-*/
**/graphify-out-*/
graphify-out_*/
**/graphify-out_*/

